s."]="Deselecciona la misi\195\179n y vuelve a la nave antes de aplicar los tiempos.",["Deselect the mission before applying timers."]="Deselecciona la misi\195\179n antes de aplicar los tiempos.",["Details saved to Logs."]="Detalles guardados en Registros.",["Diagnostic only. Both modes use buffers; not a confirmed WASP crash fix."]="Diagnostik sahaja. Kedua-dua mod guna penimbal; bukan pembaikan WASP disahkan.",["Difficulty 1 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 1",["Difficulty 10 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 10",["Difficulty 2 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 2",["Difficulty 3 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 3",["Difficulty 4 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 4",["Difficulty 5 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 5",["Difficulty 6 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 6",["Difficulty 7 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 7",["Difficulty 8 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 8",["Difficulty 9 weight"]="Pemberat kesukaran 9",["Earliest landing thrust start"]="Inicio m\195\173nimo del empuje de aterrizaje",["Effective duration: %.3f s"]="Duraci\195\179n efectiva: %.3f s",["Experimental. Each new mission starts with its timer running."]="Eksperimen. Setiap misi baharu bermula dengan pemasanya berjalan.",["FREEZE TIMER"]="BEKUKAN PEMASA",["Freeze"]="Bekukan",["Freeze automatically"]="Bekukan secara automatik",["Freeze the mission countdown. The host controls it; other players with HD2Runtime follow."]="Bekukan kiraan detik misi. Hos mengawalnya; pemain lain dengan HD2Runtime mengikutinya.",["Freezing the timer needs a newer HD2Runtime."]="Membekukan pemasa memerlukan HD2Runtime yang lebih baharu.",["Game state: %s"]="Estado del juego: %s",["Heatsink change"]="Tukar penyerap haba",["Heatsinks"]="Sinki haba",["Host: %s"]="Anfitri\195\179n: %s",["Includes dormant event and developer variants."]="Incluye variantes inactivas de eventos y desarrollo.",["Inherited"]="Diwarisi",["Landing horizontal braking share"]="Proporci\195\179n de frenado horizontal al aterrizar",["Landing thrust"]="Empuje de aterrizaje",["Landing thrust